# Xiaomi 15 Ultra security HAL synchronization.
# The stock QTI KeyMint/Gatekeeper services can come up with stale operation
# state during early boot. Re-sync the vendor HALs after /data is available,
# then restart their framework clients only after both HALs are ready.

on post-fs-data
    restart vendor.keymint-qti
    restart vendor.gatekeeper_default
    wait_for_prop init.svc.vendor.keymint-qti running
    wait_for_prop init.svc.vendor.gatekeeper_default running
    restart keystore2
    restart gatekeeperd
